Well the records of the high-ascension players on NAO seem to indicate
that it is possible.

There are lots of things one could do under the heading of Really
Trying that are counter-productive.  Endless trap searching is one of
them.  The way to handle traps, in my opinion, is not to worry too much
about them, but instead develop an exploration strategy that minimizes
the number of risky steps taken and be generally well-off enough so
that any traps triggered will probably be survivable.  This one one way
in which Nethack is still similar to Rogue.

